libdicom
------------------------------------------
libdicom is a C library and a set of command-line tools for reading DICOM WSI
files.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdicom-devel-1.3.0-1bl2
  libdicom1-1.3.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  uthash-devel-2.3.0-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ImagingDataCommons/libdicom

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ImagingDataCommons/libdicom/archive/refs/tags/v1.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdicom-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdicom-1.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdicom-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdicom-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdicom1-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdicom-devel-1.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libdicom)
  /usr/bin/dcm-dump.exe
  /usr/bin/dcm-getframe.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libdicom.README
  /usr/share/doc/libdicom/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libdicom/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/dcm-dump.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/dcm-getframe.1.gz

(libdicom1)
  /usr/bin/cygdicom-1.dll

(libdicom-devel)
  /usr/include/dicom/dicom.h
  /usr/include/dicom/version.h
  /usr/lib/libdicom.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libdicom.pc

